  "operation": "harvest",
  "summary": "Release 3.4.0 (dev skill 3.2.0, design skill 6.2.0). Harvested from five /evolve candidates adopted 2026-11-14 (.harness/evolve/20261114T23*): dev Plan drops native plan mode (Step 5 sign-off is the only gate); native task mirroring is an explicit first action per dev stage and both Completion stages close their task before the closing message; dev Implement/Test point at the installed browser procedure when Chrome tools are not connected; Context Gathering no longer commits and Ceremony's post-checkout commit is the lifecycle's first commit (dev + design); design Research passes --dir . to the graph CLI. Also promotes the already-identical direct canonical edit of docs/.og/cli.mjs (--dir validation, no stray databases) from its recorded checkpoint. INTENT checklists updated for the planning and Context-close rules.",
